        "original_id": "1fe77083-6b91-5823-9708-a07d97dc5d80",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pat Ashton, Harry Booth, Reg Varney, Doris Hare, Bob Hoskins, John Thaw\n- Products: On the Buses, Mutiny on the Buses, Thick as Thieves\n- Topics: British comedy film, English TV-sitcom film spin-offs, television series episodes\n\nFacts:\n- In 1971, Pat Ashton appeared in the English TV-sitcom film spin-off \"On the Buses,\" and her engaging Cockney blonde persona is especially remembered for that appearance.\n- In 1971, \"On the Buses\" was released as a British comedy film directed by Harry Booth and starring Reg Varney and Doris Hare.\n- In 1972, Pat Ashton appeared in the English TV-sitcom film spin-off \"Mutiny on the Buses,\" and her engaging Cockney blonde persona is especially remembered for that appearance.\n- \"Thick as Thieves\" was a television series with one series consisting of 8 episodes, and it starred Bob Hoskins, John Thaw, and Pat Ashton.",
